                        "review": "This game is good. Since this game is really old, no one is playing multiplayer and some of the stages are quite dumb. They put ammos for weapons that you do not have for beginners or weapons nearby for them. I suggest you watch the Youtube videos for each stages and then slowly try different difficulties. Also, the irritating part of this game is the aiming. Sometimes, you may shoot the barrels by accident. Hope this helps. Enjoy!",
